            "IsArray": false,
            "IsRequired": false,
            "DefaultValue": "100",
            "Description": "How many items to pull per mailbox per surface per run. MJ's GetMessages contract has no date filter, so a run fetches the most recent N and discards what it has already seen — anything older than the Nth newest message since the last run is missed and never retried."
